  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Complementary Support - State and Resilience Building Contract 3 The Gambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contract implements part of the State and Resilience Building Contract for The Gambia signed in December 2019. Complementing budget support component, the contract foresees technical assistance to strengthen democratic transition and governance. The consulting services focus on five areas: (i) economic governance - public financial management and public procurement, (ii) statistical data collection and management, (iii) business environment and private sector development, (iv) democratic reforms, and (v) anti-corruption.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
